    "The previous plan holds SEM-1, SEM-3 and FLEX-SEM (at Nov 2 08:00-09:00, now outside free time). Target C1 30 needs two seminars; every 2-seminar set has 1 activity-set change, the 3-seminar set has 0, so it wins with SEM-1 and SEM-3 KEPT and FLEX-SEM MOVED.",
